WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:12.712
♪♪

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:15.748
-Folks, Earth is the most
beautiful planet

00:00:15.748 --> 00:00:16.916
in the universe.

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:18.484
It's got everything you could
ever want --

00:00:18.484 --> 00:00:21.387
Skyscrapers, golf courses,
monster trucks, you name it.

00:00:21.387 --> 00:00:24.757
We even have cable.
But I got some bad news.

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:28.094
Through no fault of my own,
Earth is dying.

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:31.364
Personally,
I blame the immigrants.

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:34.233
But don't worry, because I'm not
gonna let it happen.

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:37.637
I'm doing everything I can think
of to save this planet.

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:38.771
[ Sloop! ]
-Sir, the planet

00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:40.840
is about to self-destruct.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:43.175
-Okay, plan B --
Let's get the hell out of here.

00:00:43.175 --> 00:00:44.310
[ Zip! ]

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.579
-With that,
President Trump gathered up

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:49.949
all his favorite family members
and loaded them onto the finest

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:53.319
space force rocket 4 billion
IOUs could buy.

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:56.188
Then, with one last look
at the planet they loved...

00:00:56.188 --> 00:00:57.590
-What a dump!

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:59.459
-...they took off
for the one place

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:02.328
they knew things
would be better -- Mars!

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:04.564
It was a long trip to Mars,

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:06.732
and Donald and his family
passed the time

00:01:06.732 --> 00:01:09.536
imagining all the wondrous
things they might find.

00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:12.371
-I bet every Mars chick
has three boobs!

00:01:12.371 --> 00:01:13.673
-Yeah, and two butts.

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:16.209
-I just hope
there's a Neiman Marcus.

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:19.278
-I'm looking forward
to dining at Taco Bell.

00:01:19.278 --> 00:01:20.546
-That reminds me --

00:01:20.546 --> 00:01:24.450
Did anyone remember to pack
the cyanide pills?

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:26.151
[ Squeaking ]

00:01:26.151 --> 00:01:27.586
Noooooooo!

00:01:27.586 --> 00:01:32.591
-But since it was space,
no one could hear her scream.

00:01:32.591 --> 00:01:35.027
Soon, the Trump family
reached Mars

00:01:35.027 --> 00:01:38.464 line:0%
and was welcomed by
the Martian president himself.

00:01:38.464 --> 00:01:41.767
-Greetings! Welcome to Mar--

00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:44.504
-I'm the president now.
Where's the pool?

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:46.773
-Pool? There's no pool.

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:48.808
We don't even have liquid water.

00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:52.077
-Great. I hate water.
I'll have a Diet Coke.

00:01:52.077 --> 00:01:54.880
-While the Martian president
searched for Diet Coke,

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:58.084
The Trumps set out to explore
their new planet.

00:01:58.084 --> 00:02:00.653
-This is mine. This is mine.
This is mine.

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:01.954
These are mine.

00:02:01.954 --> 00:02:04.156
-Can I see your third boob?
-And your second butt?

00:02:04.156 --> 00:02:06.992
-Can I see your third boob?
-And your second butt?

00:02:06.992 --> 00:02:10.096
-Where's the mall?
I was promised a mall.

00:02:10.096 --> 00:02:15.801
-Liquor? Booze? Do you know
where to get alcohol?

00:02:15.801 --> 00:02:16.836
-[ Whimpers ]

00:02:16.836 --> 00:02:19.038
-This place is almost as bad
as Earth,

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:22.241
but I know what Mars needs
to get back on track --

00:02:22.241 --> 00:02:24.943
a brand-new Trump Tower.

00:02:24.943 --> 00:02:27.680
-While Donald began demolishing
the Martian homes

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:29.348
in the way of his new building,

00:02:29.348 --> 00:02:30.983
the rest of the family went out

00:02:30.983 --> 00:02:33.486
to make their own impact
on the community.

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:35.454
Ivanka met with
Martian schoolchildren

00:02:35.454 --> 00:02:38.624
and soon had them fully employed
making handbags.

00:02:38.624 --> 00:02:40.759
-Faster! Faster! Faster!

00:02:40.759 --> 00:02:43.263
This is for your own good!

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:45.498
-Meanwhile, Eric and Don Jr.

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:47.834
were eager to check out
the local wildlife.

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:49.902
-Eric, look!

00:02:49.902 --> 00:02:53.239
It's a majestic Martian beast!

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:56.676
-Whoa!

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:58.644
-Let's kill it!
-Let's kill it!

00:02:58.644 --> 00:03:00.946
[ Zap! Zap! Zap! ]

00:03:00.946 --> 00:03:02.882
[ Click! Click! Click! ]

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:07.653
-Back at the construction site,
an angry Martian mob had formed.

00:03:07.653 --> 00:03:10.056
-Oh, thank God.
Do you have my Diet Coke?

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:11.557
-We don't have any Diet Coke,

00:03:11.557 --> 00:03:15.027
and we don't have any room
for Earthlings like you.

00:03:15.027 --> 00:03:17.463
Mars is full!

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:19.165
Round 'em up!

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:20.833
-Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:23.736
-Before long, the Trumps
did what they do best --

00:03:23.736 --> 00:03:25.738
they wore out their welcome.

00:03:25.738 --> 00:03:28.374
The Martians rose up,
and together,

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:30.509
they chased the family
back to their ship

00:03:30.509 --> 00:03:32.645
and off of their planet.

00:03:32.645 --> 00:03:35.515
Sadly, not everyone made it
on board.

00:03:35.515 --> 00:03:38.351
-Oh, no. They're going to
leave without me.

00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:42.121
What a terrible thing that
I am not at all happy about.

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:45.258
-As their ship zoomed away
from the red planet,

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:48.461
the Trumps looked toward
a bright future.

00:03:48.461 --> 00:03:52.031
-What will we do now, Daddy?
Where will we go next?

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:54.233
-Somewhere even better.

00:03:54.233 --> 00:03:58.137 line:0%
That beautiful gorgeous planet
made entirely of gold.

00:03:58.137 --> 00:04:02.475 line:0%
♪♪

00:04:02.475 --> 00:04:04.010
And now it's time

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:06.646
for "Donald J. Trump
Saves the Planet."

00:04:06.646 --> 00:04:10.349 line:0%
[ Feedback ]
I, President Donald J. Trump,

00:04:10.349 --> 00:04:12.551
am the best thing
that ever happened

00:04:12.551 --> 00:04:14.053
to our beautiful Mother Earth.

00:04:14.053 --> 00:04:17.123
I never get credit,
but before I came along,

00:04:17.123 --> 00:04:21.160
she was just a 6.5.
Now she's a solid 10.

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:22.828
And that's all thanks to me.

00:04:22.828 --> 00:04:24.997
So here are just
some of the ways

00:04:24.997 --> 00:04:27.566
I'm helping to save the planet.

00:04:27.566 --> 00:04:30.136
First, I saved us
by pulling out

00:04:30.136 --> 00:04:33.439
of that disastrous
Paris Climate Agreement.

00:04:33.439 --> 00:04:35.408
Nothing good
is ever named Paris,

00:04:35.408 --> 00:04:37.609
except for that Hilton kid.

00:04:37.609 --> 00:04:41.747
So, let's just say it was
a Paris Climate Disagreement.

00:04:41.747 --> 00:04:46.853
I fought those Greenpeace
environmental losers and won

00:04:46.853 --> 00:04:48.621
so I could open up more land

00:04:48.621 --> 00:04:51.390
to fracking
for oil and natural gas.

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:54.393
Fracking is cool because
it's the only swear word

00:04:54.393 --> 00:04:55.928
that Mike Pence
lets me say out loud.

00:04:55.928 --> 00:04:57.863 line:0%
[ Truck horn blows ]
Frack you, "New York Times."

00:04:57.863 --> 00:04:59.298 line:0%
[ Feedback, note plays ]

00:04:59.298 --> 00:05:01.900 line:0%
The climate is supposed
to change.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:04.436
That's why they call it climate
change!

00:05:04.436 --> 00:05:07.173
[ Dramatic music plays ]

00:05:07.173 --> 00:05:09.508
There's only one person
who made that possible -- Me.

00:05:09.508 --> 00:05:10.876
So vote Trump in 2020

00:05:10.876 --> 00:05:13.413
because we don't want
the climate staying the same.

00:05:13.413 --> 00:05:15.381
#MAGA.

00:05:15.381 --> 00:05:17.816
I'm the only president
who understands

00:05:17.816 --> 00:05:20.553
that hurricanes and floods
are necessary

00:05:20.553 --> 00:05:24.657
because they keep the paper
towel manufacturers in business

00:05:24.657 --> 00:05:28.360
to clean everything up.
Jobs, jobs, jobs.

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:30.162
I brought coal back

00:05:30.162 --> 00:05:33.866
because more coal means that
trains will travel even faster,

00:05:33.866 --> 00:05:36.168
like in that Denzel Washington
movie "Unstoppable,"

00:05:36.168 --> 00:05:37.970
which is what the economy
will be --

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:40.907
unstoppable, like Denzel.

00:05:40.907 --> 00:05:43.008
I put oil and coal lobbyists

00:05:43.008 --> 00:05:44.911
in charge of several
cabinet positions

00:05:44.911 --> 00:05:49.648
because government force
clean air and water onto us.

00:05:49.648 --> 00:05:53.519
I thought Democrats were against
harassment. Guess not.

00:05:53.519 --> 00:05:56.221
And that is just a few of
the ways your favorite president

00:05:56.221 --> 00:05:59.058
is making the Earth a better
place.

00:05:59.058 --> 00:06:00.760
Be sure to donate to my campaign

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:04.864
so we can put the money to good
