00:06:04.864 --> 00:06:05.731
[ Fanfare plays ]

00:06:05.731 --> 00:06:07.166
[ Party horn blows ]

00:06:07.166 --> 00:06:08.701
-[ Coughs ]
-[ Claps ]

00:06:08.701 --> 00:06:12.505 line:0%
[ Indistinct conversations ]

00:06:12.505 --> 00:06:13.906 line:0%
