00:06:13.906 --> 00:06:16.309
-And now it's time for
"Donald J. Trump

00:06:16.309 --> 00:06:19.045
and the Big Beautiful Wall."

00:06:19.045 --> 00:06:22.315
There once was a President
named Donald J. Trump.

00:06:22.315 --> 00:06:25.617
Donald loved to build things,
like skyscrapers

00:06:25.617 --> 00:06:27.553
and an angry fan base.

00:06:27.553 --> 00:06:29.488
But the one thing
he never got to build

00:06:29.488 --> 00:06:32.692
was a big, beautiful wall.

00:06:32.692 --> 00:06:36.161
The country said it was
a bad idea that wasted money,

00:06:36.161 --> 00:06:37.930
and that made Donald mad.

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:41.500
So that night before bed,
he kneeled and prayed.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.536
-Dear Colonel Sanders,
I wish for the biggest,

00:06:44.536 --> 00:06:48.174
most beautiful wall
for my border.

00:06:48.174 --> 00:06:51.443
-The next morning, he woke up
and turned on Fox News,

00:06:51.443 --> 00:06:55.080
and here it was --
a brand-new wall on the border.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:57.482
Donald flew on Air Force One
to meet it,

00:06:57.482 --> 00:07:01.053
and when he got there,
he couldn't believe his eyes.

00:07:01.053 --> 00:07:05.958
The wall was 20 feet high,
hundreds of miles long,

00:07:05.958 --> 00:07:08.494
steel, but concrete,

00:07:08.494 --> 00:07:10.662
solid, but slats.

00:07:10.662 --> 00:07:13.232
Donald hugged the wall
and exclaimed...

00:07:13.232 --> 00:07:16.002
-Hello, my big, beautiful wall.

00:07:16.002 --> 00:07:17.803
Will you be my best friend?

00:07:17.803 --> 00:07:19.071
-Of course!

00:07:19.071 --> 00:07:20.305
-...said the wall.

00:07:20.305 --> 00:07:24.376
-We will be best friends
and go on many adventures!

00:07:24.376 --> 00:07:26.078
Hop on!

00:07:26.078 --> 00:07:31.250
-So Donald jumped on the wall's
back and off they flew.

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:34.319
-Let's go fight
the Great Wall of China.

00:07:34.319 --> 00:07:35.321
-...said Trump.

00:07:35.321 --> 00:07:36.689
The wall laughed.

00:07:36.689 --> 00:07:38.624
-[ Laughs ]
I can't go there.

00:07:38.624 --> 00:07:41.359
I have to fight crime
here in America.

00:07:41.359 --> 00:07:43.262
I have a better idea.

00:07:43.262 --> 00:07:45.498
-...said the wall
as it turned on its side

00:07:45.498 --> 00:07:48.233
and dipped down into
the Rio Grande River.

00:07:48.233 --> 00:07:51.003
-I could be the world's biggest
waterslide!

00:07:51.003 --> 00:07:52.938
-Wee!

00:07:52.938 --> 00:07:55.741
-...Donald exclaimed as he
slid down into the water.

00:07:55.741 --> 00:07:58.544
-Oh, no.
Oh, I forgot I can't swim.

00:07:58.544 --> 00:07:59.678
Help me, wall.

00:07:59.678 --> 00:08:01.080
-...shouted Donald.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:04.016
But the wall couldn't help him
and flew away.

00:08:04.016 --> 00:08:05.317
-Sorry, Donald.

00:08:05.317 --> 00:08:09.555
I'm off to stop refugee children
from crossing the border!

00:08:09.555 --> 00:08:12.792
-As Donald flailed in the water,
he woke up

00:08:12.792 --> 00:08:14.426
flailing in bed.

00:08:14.426 --> 00:08:16.161
Was it all a dream?

00:08:16.161 --> 00:08:18.464
Donald quickly turned on
Fox News

00:08:18.464 --> 00:08:21.733
and saw that there was no
big, beautiful wall.

00:08:21.733 --> 00:08:23.903
Sad!

00:08:23.903 --> 00:08:26.438
So Donald took
an executive time nap

00:08:26.438 --> 00:08:28.440
so he could once more
go on adventures

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.710
with his best friend, the wall,
in his dreams.

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:38.751 line:0%
♪♪

